  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114174490526995297
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1727357282448413}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 161
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 正准备仔细观察一番洞府外的禁制，却只听一声巨响，一名红袍修士驱使着数道天火砸向那座洞府，瞬间便将外围的禁制悉数毁去。
